<title>UK: SQUASH-BRITISH OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-BRITISH OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the British Open squash championship on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat 5-Chris Walker (England) 15-5 15-9 15-12</p>
<p>3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 8-Brett Martin (Australia) 15-10 15-11 13-15 15-12</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat 6-Jonathon Power (Canada) 15-13 5-15 9-15 15-12 15-11</p>
<p>7-Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Dan Jenson (Australia) 14-15 12-15 15-13 15-10 15-12</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>10-Fiona Geaves (England) beat 12-Jane Martin (England) 9-2 9-10 9-4 9-2</p>
<p>1-Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat 5-Liz Irving (Australia) 9-1 9-3 9-2</p>
<p>4-Sue Wright (England) beat 11-Lionda Charman (England) 9-7 9-5 9-4</p>
<p>1-Michelle Martin (Australia) beat 7-Carol Owens (Australia) 9-3 9-3 9-4</p>
<p>Saturday's semifinal line-up:</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan v 7-Ahmed Barada</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles v 3-Peter Nicol</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>2-Michelle Martin v 10-Fiona Geaves</p>
<p>1-Sarah Fitz-Gerald v 4-Sue Wright</p>
</text>
